  id: story_k250
  speaker: "Anlat\u0131c\u0131"
  bodyText: "S\u0131\u011F\u0131na\u011F\u0131n kaderi K1'den beri birikmi\u015F
    250 kartl\u0131k t\xFCm kararlar\u0131n toplam\u0131na ba\u011Fl\u0131: ka\xE7
    lider geldi ge\xE7ti, hangi ittifaklar kuruldu ya da y\u0131k\u0131ld\u0131,
    konu\u015Fan zombilerle ili\u015Fki nas\u0131l \u015Fekillendi \u2014 hepsi burada
    birle\u015Fiyor. Bu h\xE2l\xE2 bir final de\u011Fildir; sistem ayn\u0131 kurallarla
    sonsuza dek \xFCretilebilir, ama bu s\u0131\u011F\u0131na\u011F\u0131n g\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFC
    burada kapan\u0131yor."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
